  "description": "A lightweight, in-memory event dispatcher and transactional outbox pattern implementation for .NET — guaranteeing reliable domain event delivery with Entity Framework Core. Solves the dual-write problem with at-least-once delivery, named queues, concurrency control, and minimal setup.",
